PROJECT TITLE
AI FITNESS PLAN

1. DEMONSTRATION OVERVIEW

The project demonstration shows how the AI Fitness Plan system works from user input to the final fitness plan.

2. DEMONSTRATION PROCESS

• Run the Python program.
• Enter the user name.
• Select the fitness goal.
• Select the fitness intensity level.
• The system processes the given information.
• A personalized 7-day fitness plan is displayed.

3. DEMONSTRATION OUTPUT

The system displays a suitable workout plan based on the selected fitness goal and intensity level. It also provides general fitness tips and rest suggestions.

4. SCREEN RECORDING

A screen recording of the project execution and output will be included as the project demonstration.

5. PROJECT RESULT

The demonstration shows that the AI Fitness Plan system successfully accepts user input and generates a suitable fitness plan.

6. FUTURE IMPROVEMENTS

